# Local dev routes for {{DISPLAY}} (BP §20), served by the ONE machine-wide Caddy.
# Mirror the route blocks below (NOT the global block) into the machine's
# conf.d/{{CODENAME}}.caddy, then `caddy validate` and `caddy reload`; or run this
# file standalone with `caddy run --config Caddyfile`. *.localhost resolves to
# loopback with no /etc/hosts entry on macOS 26+, and browsers treat it as a
# secure context. Keep these hosts in step with allowedDevOrigins, each app's
# .env.example and the CSP in the same change (BP §14).
{
	auto_https off
}
